WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.670
AssentTag starts with a group photo.

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:07.242
OpenCV finds faces and Dlib compares
them with enrolled identities.

00:00:07.598 --> 00:00:09.789
A face match still needs permission.

00:00:09.789 --> 00:00:13.266
The Django app blurs the face until it
has consent.

00:00:13.266 --> 00:00:14.884
MySQL stores the records.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:18.306
Next, evaluate missed faces and masking
failures

00:00:18.306 --> 00:00:21.255
on a representative, consented dataset.
